title: Industrial Policy
subtitle: Industry and Trade: orders, the rescue or the public control of a plant.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_industry.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'industrial_policy') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.industrial_policy (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.6). Opening and closing the card are free;
// a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card. Z — 0.94 (the user's notes
// of 24 X 2026): orders and the two ways of a plant in difficulty — a rescue that calms business or public control that angers it.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'industrial_policy');
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_industry');
!}

= Industrial policy

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Industry and Trade can place orders with home industry and decide the fate of plants in difficulty.

[+ pl_gc_plants +]

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @orders
- @rescue
- @public_control
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@orders
title: Place public orders
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month for three months. Output grows (+0.3 percentage points a month).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'orders').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_industrial_policy_orders_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'orders');
!}
go-to: result

@rescue
title: Rescue a threatened plant with credit
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month; in return the owner keeps the plant and its jobs. Business presses less at once (−4), and after two months the plant works in full again.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'rescue').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_industrial_policy_rescue_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'rescue');
!}
go-to: result

@public_control
title: Take a plant under public control
subtitle: The act goes to the Sejm, and a public board manages the plant. The workers keep their jobs, but business pressure rises sharply (+15).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'public_control').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_industrial_policy_public_control_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'public_control');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Industrial policy

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
